# Git LFS is DISABLED for now: GitHub refuses LFS uploads to public forks
# ("can not upload new objects to public fork"), and this repo is a fork of
# the original Slate docs repo. Until the repo is detached from the fork
# network (GitHub Support request, or migrate to a fresh repo), binaries go
# into plain git — fine while they stay small (generated FBX kits are ~20KB
# each). Re-enable the rules below after de-forking, then run
# `git lfs migrate import` for anything that has grown large.
#
